{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json",
  "_comment": [
    "Shared Claude Code permissions for the TravelLens project.",
    "Distilled from accumulated settings.local.json into a durable",
    "project-wide subset. Per-developer / one-off rules belong in",
    ".claude/settings.local.json (gitignored).",
    "",
    "Grouped by purpose:",
    "  1. Docker / compose / per-container exec",
    "  2. Python: venv + module entry points",
    "  3. Dependency install + inspection",
    "  4. Service health probes (dashboard, Ollama, MinIO, Airflow)",
    "  5. Pytest entry points",
    "  6. Read-only filesystem and process inspection",
    "",
    "Be conservative when expanding `allow`. An over-broad rule trades a",
    "safety prompt for a silent destructive action."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(docker --version)",
      "Bash(docker info *)",
      "Bash(docker ps *)",
      "Bash(docker compose *)",
      "Bash(docker stop *)",
      "Bash(docker rm *)",
      "Bash(docker volume *)",
      "Bash(docker exec travellens-postgres *)",
      "Bash(docker exec travellens-kafka *)",
      "Bash(docker exec travellens-minio *)",
      "Bash(docker exec travellens-zookeeper *)",
      "Bash(docker exec travellens-airflow *)",
      "Bash(docker exec travellens-airflow-postgres *)",
      "PowerShell(docker exec travellens-postgres *)",
      "PowerShell(docker exec travellens-kafka *)",
      "PowerShell(docker exec travellens-minio *)",
      "PowerShell(docker version *)",

      "Bash(python *)",
      "Bash(python3 *)",
      "Bash(.venv/Scripts/python.exe *)",
      "Bash(PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8 python *)",
      "PowerShell(python *)",
      "PowerShell(.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe *)",

      "Bash(pip install *)",
      "Bash(pip list *)",
      "PowerShell(pip install *)",
      "PowerShell(pip list *)",

      "Bash(curl -fs http://localhost:5000/*)",
      "Bash(curl -fs http://localhost:11434/api/tags)",
      "Bash(curl -fs http://localhost:8080/health)",
      "Bash(curl -fs http://localhost:9000/minio/health/live)",

      "Bash(.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m pytest *)",
      "PowerShell(.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m pytest *)",
      "Bash(python -m pytest *)",
      "PowerShell(python -m pytest *)",

      "Bash(dir)",
      "Bash(tasklist)",
      "PowerShell(Get-ChildItem -Force)",
      "PowerShell(Get-Process *)",
      "PowerShell(Get-Command *)",
      "PowerShell(Get-Job *)",

      "Read(//tmp/**)"
    ]
  }
}
